{"suttaId":"tha-ap427","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[214,242],"vripara":"68"},"segments":{"tha-ap427:0.3":"Koraṇḍapupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap427:1.1":"“Vanakammiko pure āsiṃ, pitumātumatenahaṃ [pitupitāmahenahaṃ (sī. syā. pī.)];","tha-ap427:1.3":"Pasumārena jīvāmi, kusalaṃ me na vijjati.","tha-ap427:2.1":"“Mama āsayasāmantā, tisso lokagganāyako;","tha-ap427:2.3":"Padāni tīṇi dassesi, anukampāya cakkhumā.","tha-ap427:3.1":"“Akkante ca pade disvā, tissanāmassa satthuno;","tha-ap427:3.3":"Haṭṭho haṭṭhena cittena, pade cittaṃ pasādayiṃ.","tha-ap427:4.1":"“Koraṇḍaṃ pupphitaṃ disvā, pādapaṃ dharaṇīruhaṃ;","tha-ap427:4.3":"Sakosakaṃ gahetvāna, padaseṭṭhamapūjayiṃ.","tha-ap427:5.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap427:5.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap427:6.1":"“Yaṃ yaṃ yonupapajjāmi, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;","tha-ap427:6.3":"Koraṇḍavaṇṇakoyeva, suppabhāso bhavāmahaṃ.","tha-ap427:7.1":"“Dvenavute ito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap427:7.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, padapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap427:8.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap427:9.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap427:10.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap427:11.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā koraṇḍapupphiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti;","tha-ap427:12.1":"Koraṇḍapupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
